/-! # GA 2025: Other (P3-P7; generated by R4/tools/gen_pkgs.py from specs/pkgs/ga.json)

Contribution des patentes, stated profession: architect or design office employing more than 2 persons, Libreville / Port-Gentil (tableau A, class 3, 170 000 F) (CGI 2025 art. 252-253 and the tariff annexed under art. 271 (tableau A)): art. 253: the patente is a fixed duty set by the general tariff for the professions of tableau A, or the exceptional tariff of tableaux B and C; the annexed tariff gives, for 'Architecte ou Bureau d'études (tenant un) — employant plus de 2 personnes', tableau A, class 3, 170 000 F (Libreville or Port-Gentil column). Every company line is taken to carry on that profession in one establishment in Libreville.

Taxe sur les véhicules de luxe (passenger cars above 10 CV: 20 000 or 30 000 FCFA per CV above 10, by age) (CGI 2025 (DGI Gabon edition), Livre des taxes diverses, 3.1 Taxe sur les véhicules de luxe, art. 5-11 (LFR 2018), world/B08-central-africa-fr/ga/law/cgi2025.txt l. 13711-13745; the 2025 edition holds the LFR 2018 text unchanged. Liability: the owner (art. 6), collected by insurers with the policy (art. 9-10)): art. 6: 'due par les propriétaires de véhicules de tourisme terrestres à moteur dont la puissance fiscale est supérieure à 10 CV'; art. 7: exempt diplomatic, utility and electric vehicles; art. 8: 'véhicules neufs et de moins de 5 ans : 20.000 FCFA par cheval fiscal (CV) supplémentaire ; véhicules de plus de 5 ans : 30.000 FCFA par cheval fiscal (CV) supplémentaire'. Worked case (hand): 12 CV petrol car first registered 2023 -> (12 - 10) x 20 000 = 40 000; 14 CV diesel car of 2015 -> 4 x 30 000 = 120 000. Sixteenth pass. -/

